{
  "name": "HEEEHABABY｜通知收集器（LINE OA 推播）",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HEEEHABABY 通知收集器\n後端只負責**排隊**，這條流程負責**取件、用 LINE OA 推播、回報結果**。\n\n- 每分鐘輪詢一次；後端出貨時也會打 Webhook 叫醒它（有設 NOTIFY_HOOK_URL 的話）\n- 失敗會照 1→5→15→60→360 分鐘退避重試，6 次都失敗會變成店主待辦\n- 同一則通知重試時用同一把 X-Line-Retry-Key，LINE 不會重複推播\n\n**要選的憑證（Header Auth）**\n1. 領取通知、回報結果 → `HEEEHABABY 機器金鑰`（X-Notify-Token）\n2. LINE 推播 → 沿用 `代購小幫手`（Line Messaging API 憑證）",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "2d41c01f-4d57-54bd-aec5-ca5b39d94dea",
      "name": "說明",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -48,
        -256
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "15633ec2-797a-5fc9-aab8-cf2c27d43633",
      "name": "每分鐘",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        128
      ]
    },
